    "Adapter capabilities and execution semantics are server-owned; metadata.rundesk_require rejects unsupported requirements before task/attachment admission.",
    "Both adapters disclose max_step and max_output_tokens as ignored. Existing active legacy step budgets fail safe; completed records stay frozen.",
